installation============  'beav' has to be moved to a execution directory  '.beavrc.*' files can be placed in /dd/sys, in your home directory  or local directory. The file is first searched in the local then in the  home and finally in the /dd/sys directory.OSK extensions===============  The OSK version of beav is able to recalculate the module CRC.  The new function is called 'update-module-crc' (Esc,=).  First the buffer is checked to start with $4AFC, if not an error is generated.  Then the buffer size is used as the new module size. After this the new  header parity and module CRC are calculated.